cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SWELL, please cite it with the metadata below."
type: software
title: "SWELL: a cheap automated expansion microscope (X-WOW invention #1), desk-stage design package"
authors:
  - name: "X-WOW"
version: "0.1.0-g0"
date-released: "2026-10-10"
license: CC0-1.0
url: "https://x-wow.com/swell/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/khcy82dyc2/x-wow"
abstract: >-
  An open design for a cheap, automated expansion microscope that uses the
  sarcomeres of chicken muscle as a built-in ruler for local expansion.
  Desk-stage (G0) package: simulation only, never built. Text, data and code
  are CC0 1.0 and hardware design files CERN-OHL-P v2. The X-WOW name and logo
  are excluded: X-WOW is a trade mark, and the X-WOW logo (which includes the
  name) is a registered UK trade mark, UK00003425680.
keywords:
  - expansion microscopy
  - open hardware
  - low-cost microscope
  - sarcomere
  - intrinsic ruler
  - simulation
